cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QuditClifford.jl in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file, and state the version you used.
type: software
title: QuditClifford.jl
abstract: >-
  QuditClifford.jl is a Julia package for stabilizer-tableau simulation of
  prime-dimensional qudits, for qubits and odd prime dimensions alike: pure
  and mixed stabilizer states, Clifford unitaries, uniformly random Clifford
  operators and stabilizer states, projective Pauli measurements, dephasing,
  trace-out and reset channels, expectation values, and entanglement
  measures.
authors:
